0..69 Comment "/// This source states quasi-inverses and bi-invertible equivalences."
70..73 Comment "///"
74..153 Comment "/// A quasi-inverse has one forward map, one backward map, and two round trips."
154..218 Comment "/// A bi-invertible map has independent left and right inverses."
219..222 Comment "///"
223..292 Comment "/// The checker converts a quasi-inverse into a bi-invertible record."
293..346 Comment "/// It derives a quasi-inverse from the left inverse."
347..350 Comment "///"
351..387 Comment "/// - see: #791 — `leftRetraction`"
388..419 Comment "/// - see: #674 — `equivHere`"
